IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-COALESCE-V4.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-SHARDS          PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 NUM-NUMA            PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 HIDDEN-SIZE         PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-COALESCE-V4.
    IF NUM-SHARDS == 0 OR NUM-NUMA == 0 OR HIDDEN-SIZE == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 25800 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-SHARDS.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
